    "body": "For users:\r\n\r\n* Better help text\r\n\r\n* Help text is displayed in the user's preferred pager\r\n\r\n* The `generate toc` and `generate graph` commands can be given a prefix to prepend to link URLs in generated documentation.\r\n\r\n* Bash autocompletion\r\n\r\n* For Windows users: the `adr` command can be used in `git bash`\r\n\r\n\r\nFor contributors:\r\n\r\n* Support for development on Windows.\r\n"
  },
