    "body": "New Features:\n- Uses ISO-8601 date format.\n- Added command to upgrade existing repositories to latest format: `adr upgrade-repository`\n\nFixes and Improvements:\n- Remove deprecation warnings on Linux\n- Ensure `list` command lists ADRs in order on all platforms\n- Added a mechanism for packagers to configure the application to match the installation conventions of the target platform\n"
